WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.920 line:87%
I believe that if people
had some sort of goal in their life

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.720 line:87%
and strived to achieve it,
they would live longer.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:14.480 line:94%
I never thought I'd finish a marathon,

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.800 line:87%
but so far I have completed 16 of them,
plus eight ultra-marathons.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.960 line:87%
But I am most happy about the fact
that running has allowed me

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.120 line:87%
to leave the computer
and start doing something that's fun.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.600 line:87%
Thanks to running,
I started to overcome my weaknesses

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.800 line:94%
and there were quite a few.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:39.040 line:87%
I feel stronger, more confident
and better motivated to work and act.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.320 line:87%
Running has allowed me
to come out of my shell, enjoy life

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.200 line:94%
and live my life to the fullest.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.120 line:87%
The biggest benefit
of the running event in Krynica

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:56.880 line:87%
is the fact that it is open to everybody -
professionals and amateurs.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.480 line:94%
Anyone can come and try any distance.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.080 line:87%
Short distances,
especially for young people,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.360 line:87%
are to encourage them to live healthy
lives and show them the benefits of that.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:16.920 line:87%
After completing my first ultra-marathon
I wrote some text, a page long.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.600 line:87%
My friends encouraged me
to start my own blog.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.800 line:87%
I called my blog,
Stories Written with my Legs,

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:32.640 line:87%
which reflect all that happens in a race,
meaning the stories written with my legs.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.920 line:87%
I had the honour to receive a recognition
for the Running Journalist of the Year.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.640 line:94%
I believe running forms your character.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:46.280 line:87%
You become more determined,
tougher, more punctual.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:49.760 line:87%
You start to believe
that anything is possible.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:51.920 line:94%
Even after a few failures,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.480 line:94%
you get up, try again and never give up.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:01.200 line:87%
The biggest benefit of participating
in the Erasmus+ programme

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:05.120 line:87%
is the ability to work
with partners in Europe

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:11.720 line:87%
and promote together the idea
of being active during our running event.

